WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
VERO letterforms on drafting paper, then a grid of letter tiles.

00:02.500 --> 00:06.000
Hands over a design sheet; the VERO wordmark on textured paper.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
Construction drawings reveal a geometric monogram.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.000
The monogram appears on a design sheet and a fabric sample.

00:13.000 --> 00:14.040
The VERO wordmark closes the sequence.
